    %%report compound-created-per-month title: Compounds created per month entity: Compound chart: line x: month y: records help: One registered chemical structure. New compounds per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_compound WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
    %%report compound-molecular-weight-by-compound-class title: Total molecular weight by compound class entity: Compound chart: bar x: compound_class y: total_molecular_weight help: One registered chemical structure. Compounds added up on molecular weight, split by compound class, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(compound_class::text, '(unset)') AS compound_class, ROUND(SUM(molecular_weight)::numeric, 2) AS total_molecular_weight FROM bus_compound WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
    %%report compound-molecular-weight-per-month title: Average molecular weight per month entity: Compound chart: line x: month y: average_molecular_weight help: One registered chemical structure. The average molecular weight of compounds created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(molecular_weight)::numeric, 2) AS average_molecular_weight FROM bus_compound WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
    %%report compound-largest-by-molecular-weight title: The ten largest compounds by molecular weight entity: Compound chart: bar x: record y: molecular_weight help: One registered chemical structure. The records with the highest molecular weight; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT compound_number::text AS record, molecular_weight FROM bus_compound WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND molecular_weight IS NOT NULL ORDER BY molecular_weight DESC LIMIT 10
    %%report compound-logp-by-compound-class title: Total logp by compound class entity: Compound chart: bar x: compound_class y: total_logp help: One registered chemical structure. Compounds added up on logp, split by compound class, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(compound_class::text, '(unset)') AS compound_class, ROUND(SUM(logp)::numeric, 2) AS total_logp FROM bus_compound WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
