    %%report compound-largest-by-logp title: The ten largest compounds by logp entity: Compound chart: bar x: record y: logp help: One registered chemical structure. The records with the highest logp; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT compound_number::text AS record, logp FROM bus_compound WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND logp IS NOT NULL ORDER BY logp DESC LIMIT 10
    %%report compound-tpsa-by-compound-class title: Total tpsa by compound class entity: Compound chart: bar x: compound_class y: total_tpsa help: One registered chemical structure. Compounds added up on tpsa, split by compound class, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(compound_class::text, '(unset)') AS compound_class, ROUND(SUM(tpsa)::numeric, 2) AS total_tpsa FROM bus_compound WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
