    %%report assay-run-by-status title: Assay Runs by status entity: AssayRun chart: pie x: status y: records help: One execution of an assay — typically one plate, on one instrument, on one day, by one operator. How assay runs divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_assay_run WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
