    %%report instrument-last-calibration-date-per-month title: Instruments by last calibration date entity: Instrument chart: line x: month y: records help: A piece of laboratory equipment that produces data. Instruments grouped by the month of last calibration date, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', last_calibration_date), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_instrument WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND last_calibration_date IS NOT NULL AND last_calibration_date >= now() - interval '24 months' AND last_calibration_date < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
