    %%report capa-lifecycle title: CAPA lifecycle entity: CAPA chart: bar x: state y: records help: A corrective and preventive action — what was done about a deviation, and what stops it happening again. Where capas sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'open' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'in_progress', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'pending_verification', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'closed', 3 UNION ALL SELECT 'cancelled', 4) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_capa WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
    %%report capa-created-per-month title: CAPAs created per month entity: CAPA chart: line x: month y: records help: A corrective and preventive action — what was done about a deviation, and what stops it happening again. New capas per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_capa WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
